parameters.prompt:
Lightwell Network does not yet have a signed backport for this advisory.

Triage result:
${analyze_agent.result.content}

Trigger fields:
- advisory_id: ${trigger.advisory_id}
- cve_id: ${trigger.cve_id}
- severity: ${trigger.severity}
- package_name: ${trigger.package_name}
- patched_version: ${trigger.patched_version}
- affected_app: ${trigger.affected_app}
- lightwell_patch_available: ${trigger.lightwell_patch_available}

Write a short investigation note for the platform team. Use AAP MCP tools if available to confirm there is no additional job template already covering this CVE.

Focus on:
- whether the application is actually running the vulnerable package
- why a Lightwell backport is the preferred fix (API compatibility / no major upgrade)
- compensating controls until Lightwell Clearinghouse releases the patch
- the next operator action

Output ONLY valid JSON:
{
  "host_actually_affected": true,
  "workaround_available": false,
  "workaround_description": "",
  "risk_summary": "",
  "recommended_action": ""
}
